<title>USA: New York Stock Exchange seat sold for $1,050,000.</title>
<headline>New York Stock Exchange seat sold for $1,050,000.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said a seat was sold for $1,050,000, down $112,500 from the previous sale on August 20. The bid was $1,000,000 and the offer was $1,225,000.</p>
